{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12371","headline":"闲居酬张起居见赠 · 钱起","name":"闲居酬张起居见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"在林非避世，守拙自离羣。\n弱羽谢风水，穷愁依典坟。\n良知不遐弃，新咏独相闻。\n能使幽兴苦，坐忘清景曛。\n前山带乔木，暮鸟联归云。\n向夕野人思，难忘骑省文。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}